的朋友，正好发奋，","text_sha256":"a00031edc2519de60f651cd82b5e510f2c72b4478b38f2b23f1659513f333e07"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":8,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":15609134,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":15609134,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":210,"start":204,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:128"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:8","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:8:p00005","text":"甲侧未\n必。","text_sha256":"6f27bd382422f66016be289222b96cfabb32c426bf79c452bd31bcf8c6fbf5aa"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":204,"exact_span_text":" \n  题曰： \n    古鼎新烹凤髓香，那堪翠斝贮琼浆。 \n    莫言绮縠无风韵，试看金娃对玉郎。 \n \n  话说凤姐和宝玉回家，见过众人。宝玉先便回明贾母，秦\n钟要上家塾之事，自己也有了个伴读的朋友，正好发奋，","extraction_text_sha256":"d4cfda244602ca15c384ea14169766a46e959f2aa8916f86af97803093c4753f","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":127,"physical_page_one_based":128,"start":96,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:128","viewer_fragment":"#page=128"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 8","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:8:p00004","text_sha256":"a00031edc2519de60f651cd82b5e510f2c72b4478b38f2b23f1659513f333e07"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":8,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee