t:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":9,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":158,"start":146,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:145"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:9","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:9:p00005","text":"戚夹妙！不知是怎样相遇。","text_sha256":"67479a4bf8c7cb55ce9b997dd1b1fbeb7651d39fa26c92413dd3afd60f7eb199"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":146,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说秦业父子专候贾家的人来送上学择日之信。原来宝玉\n急于要和秦钟相遇，","extraction_text_sha256":"2a4d6572633d5becb0b527504e35e7707c53f686838ef432b3e7f5afec005494","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":144,"physical_page_one_based":145,"start":107,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:145","viewer_fragment":"#page=145"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 9","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:9:p00004","text_sha256":"5734c879be76335773934e9e9d56bdd290e83e129954e3afeba91cb6bea6fe5f"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":9,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":146,"start":107,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:145"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:9","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:9:p00004","text":" \n  话说秦业父子专候贾家的人来送上学择日之信。原来宝玉\n急于要和秦钟相遇，","text_sha256":"5734c879be76335773934e9e9d56bdd290e83e129954e3afeba91cb6bea6fe5f"}},{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":10,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":94,"start":58,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:156"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:10","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:10:p00003","text":"戚新样幻情欲收拾，可卿从此世无缘。和肝益气浑闲事，\n谁识今朝寻病源？ \n","text_sha256":"2fa11ff778485aeca5e435cf4183fd3fb0c3729fecec1a94af9e0d2619808f6c"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":10,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":278,"start":94,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:156"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:10","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:10:p00004","text":" \n  话说金荣因人多势众，又兼贾瑞勒令，赔了不是，给秦钟\n磕了头，宝玉方才不吵闹了。大家散了学，金荣回到家中，越\n想越气，说：“秦钟不过是贾蓉的小舅子，又不是贾家的子孙，\n附学读书，也不过和我一样。他因仗着宝玉和他好，他就目中\n无人。他既是这样，就该行些正经事，人也没的说。他素日又\n和宝玉鬼鬼祟祟的，只当我们都是瞎子，看不见。今日他又去\n勾搭人，偏偏的撞在我眼里。","text_sha256":"8e797637069ecfbe1907fff2ade1f754b955b25017bdde52ed7a386d1b0cc5f0"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":10,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":303,"start":278,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:156"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:10","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:10:p00005","text":"蒙侧偏是鬼鬼祟祟者，多以为人不见其行，\n不知其心。","text_sha256":"c6311ff54fd37ea612cc3bdbf01879873735bad24ddbb0ceb3b3431bbcdb66e1"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":278,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说金荣因人多势众，又兼贾瑞勒令，赔了不是，给秦钟\n磕了头，宝玉方才不吵闹了。大家散了学，金荣回到家中，越\n想越气，说：“秦钟不过是贾蓉的小舅子，又不是贾家的子孙，\n附学读书，也不过和我一样。他因仗着宝玉和他好，他就目中\n无人。他既是这样，就该行些正经事，人也没的说。他素日又\n和宝玉鬼鬼祟祟的，只当我们都是瞎子，看不见。今日他又去\n勾搭人，偏偏的撞在我眼里。","extraction_text_sha256":"6af9c3d022fae4ad97a8872bdc37fd8ecb176bacea157dfeeb61552ddb1a732e","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":155,"physical_page_one_based":156,"start":94,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:156","viewer_fragment":"#page=156"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 10","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:10:p00004","text_sha256":"8e797637069ecfbe1907fff2ade1f754b955b25017bdde52ed7a386d1b0cc5f0"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":10,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":278,"start":94,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:156"}],"tr